    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>911: Cannibal</strong> \u2013 A terrifying first-person horror game of hide and seek, puzzles, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been kidnapped by a maniac. Not just any maniac\u2026 a cannibal \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f who hunts people and plays games with his victims. Trapped in his eerie house \ud83c\udfda\ufe0f in the middle of nowhere, your only hope is to stay quiet, stay smart, and find a way out before dinner is served\u2014and you\u2019re the main course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Explore the house, find hidden objects, solve puzzles, and piece together the twisted story of Minnesota\u2019s most feared killer. But be careful: the cannibal is always listening, always hunting. Make one wrong move, leave behind one clue\u2014and your nightmare might end in his kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 A branching detective story filled with mystery and fear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 First-person survival gameplay with intense stealth mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Atmospheric sound design and detailed environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Collect notes to uncover the maniac's twisted past\u00a0\ud83d\udd13</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Hide and seek horror \u2013 stay quiet or be hunted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you <strong>survive the horror</strong>, or will you become part of the story?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>911: Cannibal</strong> \u2013 A terrifying first-person horror game of hide and seek, puzzles, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been kidnapped by a maniac. Not just any maniac\u2026 a cannibal \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f who hunts people and plays games with his victims. Trapped in his eerie house \ud83c\udfda\ufe0f in the middle of nowhere, your only hope is to stay quiet, stay smart, and find a way out before dinner is served\u2014and you\u2019re the main course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Explore the house, find hidden objects, solve puzzles, and piece together the twisted story of Minnesota\u2019s most feared killer. But be careful: the cannibal is always listening, always hunting. Make one wrong move, leave behind one clue\u2014and your nightmare might end in his kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 A branching detective story filled with mystery and fear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 First-person survival gameplay with intense stealth mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Atmospheric sound design and detailed environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Collect notes to uncover the maniac's twisted past\u00a0\ud83d\udd13</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Hide and seek horror \u2013 stay quiet or be hunted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you <strong>survive the horror</strong>, or will you become part of the story?</p>",
